<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Advtech in further talks, issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>Advtech in further talks, issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Technical Systems Ltd on Friday said that negotiations earlier referred to were still in progress which, if successful, could have an effect on Advtech's share price on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company advised shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>An earlier cautionary announcement was made on March 5.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
